OL,3,ANearly three million Teslas recalled in
OL,4,AChina over hidden door handles
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinimalistic door handles became a
OL,7,Fsignature feature of electric vehicles
OL,8,F(EVs), but the controversial designs
OL,9,Fare now at the centre of China's
OL,10,Fbiggest car recall, affecting more than
OL,11,F4 million vehicles.
OL,13,FThe recall, which includes 2.98 million
OL,14,FChinese-made Teslas, follows safety
OL,15,Fconcerns that the hidden door handles
OL,16,Fare difficult to locate and open in
OL,17,Femergency situations.
OL,19,FOther brands affected by the recall
OL,20,Finclude Chinese carmakers XPeng, Xiaomi
OL,21,Fand Geely.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
